{
    "initializationAction": [
        "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' add InDialogue');",
        "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
        "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run playsound darkskies record @s[tag=!RadioOff] ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
        "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run scoreboard players add @s MusicCooldown 103');"
    ],
    "escapeAction": [],
    "speakers": {
        "looker": {
            "name": "Looker",
            "face": {
                "type": "artificial",
                "modelType": "npc",
                "identifier": "cobblemon:looker",
                "isLeftSide": true
            }
        },
        "player": {
            "face": "q.player.face(true);",
            "name": {
                "type": "expression",
                "expression": "q.player.username"
            }
        }
    },
    "pages": [
        {
            "id": "greeting",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'' + q.player.username + ', have you seen the news? The purloining of Pok\u00e9mon continues!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page2');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "It is unforgivable! We have not yet closed the case at the museum, but..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "When you consider how many are suffering, we must pursue the culprits!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "I have devised an absolutely amazing plan that will bring an immediate solution."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "It will be a sting operation!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "It appears the criminals are targeting Trainers in places where there are no witnesses."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "If that is indeed the case, then we can simply bait a trap and wait!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "First the \u201cvictim\u201d will go to some deserted location and act lost."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "The criminals will think they've found an easy mark, and they will surely reveal themselves!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "All the reports say they like to challenge their victims to battle before stealing their Pok\u00e9mon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "That's when we'll get them! Right when they are distracted by the heat of a Pok\u00e9mon battle!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "The backup, who will be hiding and watching, will appear and help take down the criminals!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Indeed. What do you think? It is not without risk, but it's quite the best plan we have!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'However! The plan will never succeed without you, ' + q.player.username + '!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Now, as to our assignments..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "There is little to decide, since you are aware that I have no Pok\u00e9mon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Your role is therefore to play the victim in our little sting operation."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "I will conceal myself in the shadows and watch for my opening to attack."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page19",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Keep your Pok\u00e9mon ready to spring into battle when the criminals appear!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page20');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page20",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "I ask myself how to draw these miscreants into approaching us."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page21');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page21",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "What we need is a place in this bustling city that is a little deserted, perhaps."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page22');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page22",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'A nice, neglected alley is exactly what I have in mind. Come, ' + q.player.username + '! The game is afoot!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page23",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Let us begin the hunt close to home!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page24');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page24",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "The nearest alley is right beside this building. It connects to Autumnal Avenue."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page25');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page25",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'Go quickly, ' + q.player.username + '! I will be right behind you!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Close",
                        "value": "close",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' add Dialogue188');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' remove InDialogue');",
                            "q.dialogue.close();"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}